# Keep text files LF in every working tree.
#
# The benchmark publishes SHA-256 hashes of the corpus and the detector
# sources. A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true would rewrite them with
# CRLF and make those hashes unreproducible, so line endings are pinned here
# rather than left to each contributor's git configuration.
#
# Existing clones: run `git add --renormalize .` once after pulling this file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
